{
  "edges": [
    {
      "fromKey": "n-rga8k8",
      "toKey": "n-x3ngwa",
      "type": "caused",
      "rationale": "The desk entries do not log every field operation (supported), and the area directory is a location index that does not establish valve positions or pressure availability at any given time (supported). The lack of detailed logging in shift records means we cannot determine if an unrecorded service-routing change occurred, but this gap itself contributes to uncertainty about whether normal conditions were maintained.",
      "status": "unknown",
      "sourceIds": ["24ec1587-92e9-4320-82c2-30368d834f1d#1", "b678a928-a8d2-472d-bc03-2e1a3dc411e6#1"],
      "claimIds": ["finding-1hfd1r1"],"counterfactual":"If field operations were fully logged, we could determine whether valve positions changed without proper documentation.","competingExplanation":"The interruption may have originated upstream or downstream of the RHOB area, unrelated to local logging gaps.","evidenceGap":"No evidence confirms whether an unrecorded service-routing change occurred; only that records are incomplete and directories do not show real-time status."
    },
    {
      "fromKey": "n-109kb97",
      "toKey": "n-x3ngwa",
      "type": "caused",
      "rationale": "The work package cover indicates the temporary instruction attachment field was blank at issue time (supported), and the area directory does not establish valve positions or pressure availability (supported). A blank attachment suggests that no approved change documentation accompanied the work, which may have contributed to an unverified hazard scenario.",
      "status": "unknown",
      "sourceIds":["eaee59fe-70f4-4876-a21d-780814412078#1","b678a928-a8d2-472d-bc03-2e1a3dc411e6#1"],
      "claimIds": ["finding-1547cs1"],"counterfactual":"If a temporary instruction had been attached, it would have documented any service-routing changes and their impact on the maintenance boundary.","competingExplanation":"The interruption may have occurred due to an external factor (third-party work or utility outage) unrelated to documentation gaps.","evidenceGap":"No evidence confirms whether a service-routing change actually occurred; only that no temporary instruction was attached at issue time."
    },
    {
      "fromKey": "n-1jn9d4s",
      "toKey": "n-x3ngwa",
      "type": "caused",
      "rationale": "'Normal band' is the operator's entry, not a captured numeric measurement (supported), and the area directory does not establish valve positions or pressure availability at any given time (supported). This means that reliance on qualitative entries like 'normal band' without quantitative data may have masked an actual supply disturbance.",
      "status": "unknown",
      "sourceIds":["24ec1587-92e9-4320-82c2-30368d834f1d#1","b678a928-a8d2-472d-bc03-2e1a3dc411e6#1"],
      "claimIds": ["finding-1yf38nl"],"counterfactual":"If numeric pressure measurements were recorded, we could determine whether the 'normal band' entry accurately reflected actual supply conditions.","competingExplanation":"The interruption may have been caused by a physical failure in the distribution system unrelated to recordkeeping practices.","evidenceGap":"No evidence confirms whether the operator's qualitative entries masked an actual supply disturbance; only that measurements are not captured numerically."
    }
  ],
  "decision": {
    "summary": "The investigation identifies three causal branches: (1) incomplete logging of field operations contributes to uncertainty about valve positions and pressure availability; (2) a blank temporary instruction attachment suggests no approved change documentation accompanied the work; (3) reliance on qualitative entries like 'normal band' without quantitative data may have masked an actual supply disturbance. All edges are marked as unknown due to insufficient evidence confirming whether these factors directly caused the interruption or if external causes were responsible.",
    "evidenceUsed": ["24ec1587-92e9-4320-82c2-30368d834f1d#1", "b678a928-a8d2-472d-bc03-2e1a3dc411e6#1", "eaee59fe-70f4-4876-a21d-780814412078#1"],
    "unknowns": ["Whether an unrecorded service-routing change occurred; whether external factors caused the interruption; whether qualitative entries masked actual supply disturbances."],
    "alternatives": ["The interruption originated upstream or downstream of RHOB, unrelated to local documentation gaps.", "An external factor (third-party work or utility outage) caused the interruption."],
    "confidence": 0.65
  },"evidenceRequests":[
    "requestId-1","sourceId:eaee59fe-70f4-4876-a21d-780814412078#1,claimRef:finding-hpozhz",
    "questionText:Does the work package cover (IA-S02) or any other record confirm whether a service-routing change occurred between 2024-03-01 and May 20, 2024?"
  ]}
